cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, or results derived from it, please cite it."
title: "Closing the Distance: The Modality Gap in MLLM Captioning"
abstract: >-
  Code and results that describe the alignment between image and text at the
  input of a connector-based multimodal large language model by four
  properties (location, scale, shape and orientation) and drive each in turn
  during training while holding the other three, to attribute image-captioning
  quality to each property.
type: software
authors:
